WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.799 --> 00:00:02.790
We have a voicemail number.

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.470
That number is 2 1 9 2.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.610
David P..

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.330
Take a listen to this one.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:08.570
Hi, David.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.310
I'm a recent member.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.950
I recently canceled my recurring NPR donation.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.529
You remember since your show was pretty virtuous.

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:22.199
I want to let you know I really love your
show for two reasons.

00:00:22.199 --> 00:00:28.249
One is the rational, sober adherence to truth
and reality over partisanship when it's necessary.

00:00:28.249 --> 00:00:34.660
I really appreciate hearing hard truths over
pleasing lies or optimistic magical thinking.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:38.870
Number two, because of your lack of hyperbole
and B.S., I still share your videos.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:46.250
I know the info is going to be solid and I
won't have to spend time defending the source.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.949
I really enjoy what you're putting out, man.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.679
I love the voicemail.

00:00:51.679 --> 00:00:53.500
I love the financial support.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.269
I love the ideological support and the sharing
on social media support.

00:00:57.269 --> 00:01:01.579
That being said, we're not asking people to
cancel NPR to sign up for The David Pakman

00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:02.579
Show.

00:01:02.579 --> 00:01:04.159
I guess for some people it's one or the other.

00:01:04.159 --> 00:01:05.159
NPR.

00:01:05.159 --> 00:01:11.080
Very important people who primarily get news
from NPR are much more informed than people

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:13.140
who primarily get news from many other sources.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.710
So we love NPR.

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:16.050
We love our supporters.

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:18.120
We've got a great bonus show for you today.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:22.400
I have a crazy story from the weekend involving
the police.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.640
OK, I'm not going to say more.

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:25.700
I will tell it.

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:26.700
On today's bonus script.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:26.707
The David Pakman Show David Pakman dicom.

